    "updated_at": "2026-08-31T16:26:27Z",
    "body": "Pre-data registration correction: the source audit established that RGI 7 uses first-order codes 01-20. Region 20 is Antarctic Mainland and currently contributes no glacier outlines, but it must be represented explicitly rather than silently omitted. The issue and protocol now use 01-20. The same audit confirmed that PZI is used only at reporting centers, so the intrinsic domain admits integer south edges -60 through 89; a symmetric 0.1-degree staging collar is not a scientific requirement and will be clipped at the PZI edge. No new RGI region, DEM value, or PZI value had been retrieved or opened when this correction was made.",
