    "updated_at": "2026-08-31T16:34:12Z",
    "body": "Pre-data registration audit corrections, all made before any frame retrieval: (1) the randomization target is anchored to exactly one unedited issue comment naming the remote frame commit, with created_at equal to updated_at; (2) the NIST request is next/(target-1 ms), because next is strictly after its argument; (3) certificate validity, canonical signature, and previous-pulse linkage must verify before outputValue is used; (4) HMAC uses bytes.fromhex(outputValue), the canonical LF frame.csv hash, and exact UTF-8 cell keys, with any collision stopping; (5) dominant-region contribution is geodesic area of the cell intersected with the per-region outline union; and (6) sample variance/covariance divisor, Satterthwaite degrees of freedom, all-zero variance, RSE, covariance, and structural-zero rules are explicit. Independent registration audit: APPROVE, no remaining blocker. No RGI frame, DEM, or PZI value was accessed.",
