    "body": "Post-registration, pre-geometry packaging clarification: the RGI 7 regional distribution index publishes packages for regions 01-19. Region 20 is defined as Antarctic Mainland but currently contains no RGI glaciers and has no regional archive. The issue and protocol now require exact 01-19 packages plus the official region-20 definition, distribution index, and explicit zero contribution. No outline geometry, DEM value, or PZI value had been opened when this source-specific correction was made.",
